Package: quadruped_localization
File: scripts/map_registration.py

This project implementation migrates the multi-scale point-to-point ICP approach
from That-nav's global_localization.py, with explicit frame conversion, bounded
inputs, range/FOV cropping, coarse-to-fine chaining, result quality checks,
geometry screening and correction gates. It is not the original ROS node.

